==Battleground==
*1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
*6 [[Lucky Dags]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Lucky Dags will one shot just about anything, but they're single attack. Using a lot of meatshields will keep them from hitting your attackers. [[Jiangshi Cat]] makes this stage trivial, as they can take two hits from the Lucky Dags and they won't instantly die to Director Kurosawah. [[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Cat]] is also good for this stage with his dodge ability. Just be wary of your money on this stage. You might want to bring a wallet-related combo.

